> What is the training corpus in Section 4.3?

In the experiment in Section 4.3, we measured performance at each mid-checkpoint of the PT model, using checkpoints provided by OLMo rather than models we trained ourselves (https://huggingface.co/allenai/OLMo-2-1124-13B/tree/main
). As shown in Figure 4, we evaluated performance from the earliest model parameter checkpoint in Stage 1 through the checkpoints in Stage 2. Stage 1 used the OLMo 2 Mix 1124 model trained on datasets collected from the web, including text, code, and math, while Stage 2 used a model trained on the “ingredient 4” dataset, which reportedly achieved the best performance in the math domain.
